[[File:Map040.png|center|350px]]
'''Cats Cradle Basin''' (バリチッチ盆地, ''Barichitchi Bonchi'', '''Barichicchi Basin''') is the 3rd sub-chapter of [[Zero Legends]], and the 101st sub-chapter overall. It was introduced in [[Version 12.3 Update|Version 12.3]] and is available up to {{2c}} difficulty.

==Difficulty==
Most of the stages here are not as simple as they seem to be, as they need a specific strategy to beat them. To lower the difficulty, it is highly recommended to have most of the [[Uncanny Legends]] units' True Forms, as [[:Category:Relic Enemies|Relics]] and [[:Category:Behemoth Enemies|Behemoths]] make many appearances here. On the other hand, you will face rematches with familiar bosses like [[Daboo of the Dead]] and [[Corrupted Valkyrie]].
{{LegendDiff|120}}

==New Features==
This sub-chapter introduces 5 enemies to Zero Legends:
*[[Daboo of the Dead]]: A towering [[:Category:Zombie Enemies|Zombie]] enemy that made his debut in [[Parade of the Dead (Deadly)|Dead on Debut]]. He has extreme amounts of health, range, damage, inflicts [[Slow]] for 10 seconds, is immune to Knockback, Weaken, Slow and Freeze, and revives infinitely at 10% HP if he is not defeated by a [[:Category:Zombie Killer Cats|Zombie Killer]].
*[[Devil Wife]]: An [[:Category:Aku Enemies|Aku]] variant of [[Celeboodle]] with very similar stats and a 100% [[Surge Attack#Death Surge|Death Surge]] chance upon death.
*[[Corrupted Valkyrie]]: A [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]]/[[:Category:Alien Enemies|Alien]] enemy introduced as the final boss of the 2nd [[Into the Future]] chapter. Has rather high HP and damage, and [[Strengthen|strengthens]] by 100% at 40% HP.
*[[Vermilingua Rangmaster]]: An Aku/[[:Category:Behemoth Enemies|Behemoth]] variant of [[Master A.]] with a powerful [[Shield]], 2-part Multi-Hit attack, and slightly longer backswing.
*[[Elephantidae Papaou]]: A Behemoth variant of [[Le'boin]] with a slower movement speed but a much faster attack rate and immunity to all status effects Cats can inflict. The only enemy completely new to this sub-chapter.

